hildren":["Skill Training (Stealth)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Training_(Stealth)"}," feats. Additionally, whenever you use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," skill, all your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Followers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Followers","referenceId":"reference:a145ab342a4a3b94"}," can also make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks as a part of the same action if they are able to.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can select this Talent up to three times. Each time you do, you gain one additional ",{"tag":"a","children":["Follower"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Follower"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Close-Combat Assault"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Reconnaissance Team Leader"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Each of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Followers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Followers","referenceId":"reference:a145ab342a4a3b94"}," gains the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Point-Blank Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Point-Blank_Shot","referenceId":"reference:7464dcbe8125c639"}," feat.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["This section was titled Get Into Position in its official source, but has been renamed to distinguish it from the similarly named \"",{"tag":"a","children":["Get Into Position"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Get_Into_Position"},".\""]}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Get Into Their Positions"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," +5, ",{"tag":"b","children":["Reconnaissance Team Leader"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},", you can cause one of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Followers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Followers","referenceId":"reference:a145ab342a4a3b94"}," to move up to his or her ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," +2 squares.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Reconnaissance Actions"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Reconnaissance Team Leader"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You and your reconnaissance team have learned to work together as a cohesive unit and have an established set of tactics, which you have practiced to perfection. You can use any of the following actions on your turn:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Forward Scouting:"]}," As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against a target in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". For each of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Followers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Followers","referenceId":"reference:a145ab342a4a3b94"}," armed with a ranged weapon who has ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," to your target, you can grant one ally a +2 insight bonus on attack rolls against the target until the end of your next turn. Thus, if you have multiple arme